{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54041","headline":"王子颂五首 诞生 · 良价","name":"王子颂五首 诞生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天然贵胤本非功，德合乾坤育势隆。\n始末一期无杂种，分宫六宅不他宗。\n上和下睦阴阳顺，共气连枝器量同。\n欲识诞生王子父，鹤腾霄汉出银笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}